Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-vrr
Version: 1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Variable refresh rate for the modesetting driver of XLibre
 X11 OutputClass section that enables variable refresh rate in the
 modesetting driver (default: off). VRR is only used by fullscreen
 applications that flip via the Present extension on a VRR-capable
 display. Not recommended for experiments that need a fixed refresh
 rate.
